WEBVTT

00:11.670 --> 00:12.490
Watch closely.

00:12.510 --> 00:13.490
This man is Guang.

00:13.910 --> 00:14.890
He burns with towering rage

00:14.910 --> 00:16.780
to rule the whole world.

00:19.870 --> 00:20.650
You're overthinking it.

00:21.640 --> 00:22.490
In reality,

00:23.230 --> 00:24.580
he toils until thirty,

00:25.000 --> 00:27.050
only to fall gravely ill.

00:27.710 --> 00:28.940
Without a protagonist's halo,

00:29.350 --> 00:31.010
[Investiture of Deities]
I have to rely on the stories.

00:31.550 --> 00:32.980
Why can't

00:33.200 --> 00:35.900
these protagonists just win
with caution?

00:36.070 --> 00:36.820
That's it.

00:36.920 --> 00:37.820
Another botched ending.

00:43.640 --> 00:44.540
My book...

00:44.540 --> 00:45.140
[Prequel to the Primordial Investiture
of Deities]

00:54.390 --> 00:56.300
Standing out can get you stricken.

00:56.470 --> 00:58.770
Moving rashly can get you hurt.

01:06.430 --> 01:08.130
If only I could start over...

01:09.310 --> 01:10.850
[Fate's Sundial Illusion]
Thy heart is filled with remorse.

01:11.310 --> 01:13.290
I grant thee rebirth through samsara.

01:13.400 --> 01:14.490
Next stop:

01:14.870 --> 01:16.330
the Primordial Wilds.

01:17.310 --> 01:19.330
What? The Primordial Wilds?

01:19.760 --> 01:20.540
Could it be

01:20.560 --> 01:23.130
the perilous Primordial Wilds
from the book?

01:23.350 --> 01:24.930
The Way is complete at fifty,

01:25.120 --> 01:26.740
yet fate only yields forty-nine.

01:27.710 --> 01:28.740
Go now,

01:29.000 --> 01:30.820
the only one who escaped fate.

01:33.760 --> 01:35.620
This is the Primordial World.

01:35.840 --> 01:37.570
Deadly tribulations lie everywhere.

01:37.570 --> 01:38.280
[The world within the comic]

01:38.280 --> 01:39.620
Watch closely.

01:40.400 --> 01:41.410
I've come into the book.

01:41.680 --> 01:43.210
Could this be a tutorial stage?

01:43.950 --> 01:44.690
Cultivator A

01:44.950 --> 01:46.260
fell into a forest swamp

01:46.280 --> 01:47.180
and drowned.

01:47.850 --> 01:50.100
Ah!

01:50.640 --> 01:51.260
Cultivator B

01:51.510 --> 01:54.050
was killed by a giant python
while herb picking.

01:54.180 --> 01:56.180
[Gasp! Hiss]

01:56.400 --> 01:57.210
Cultivator C

01:57.230 --> 01:59.260
seized a demon core
and got hacked to death

01:59.400 --> 02:00.620
by a companion.

02:00.900 --> 02:01.780
[Whoosh]

02:03.480 --> 02:04.130
Cultivator D

02:04.590 --> 02:06.410
saved a damsel in distress
and fell into a honey trap.

02:06.790 --> 02:07.740
He died unjustly.

02:07.740 --> 02:09.150
Ah!

02:09.150 --> 02:10.890
Died in Tribulation.
Died while watching.

02:11.840 --> 02:14.290
A million ways to die
in the Primordial Wilds.

02:14.680 --> 02:16.820
Thank you, Fate, for the instruction.

02:17.260 --> 02:17.940
[Tap]

02:19.190 --> 02:20.100
Don't touch karma.

02:20.280 --> 02:21.610
Steadiness comes first.

02:21.710 --> 02:23.730
Fortunately, I've read the entire book.

02:23.870 --> 02:26.380
[Scripture of Steadiness]
I've grasped the method of survival.

02:26.680 --> 02:27.690
There's nothing to fear in the book.

02:28.030 --> 02:29.660
Seeking life from within death

02:29.680 --> 02:31.340
is easier said than done.

02:32.030 --> 02:32.940
The next comes

02:33.150 --> 02:35.890
a brand-new chapter
in the Primordial Wilds.

02:36.520 --> 02:38.170
A brand-new storyline?

02:38.170 --> 02:39.620
[33 years later]

02:39.620 --> 02:40.620
[Into the Primordial World]

02:40.620 --> 02:41.500
[Into the Ascendance Sect]

02:41.500 --> 02:42.740
[Previous life]

02:44.080 --> 02:45.260
Tian.

02:45.680 --> 02:46.380
At your service.

02:47.150 --> 02:48.170
Open the plan schedule.

02:52.240 --> 02:53.260
Steadiness does not mean

02:53.910 --> 02:55.380
mere hiding;

02:56.080 --> 02:57.410
it is planning before acting.

02:59.980 --> 03:03.260
[Plan Schedule: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]

03:07.430 --> 03:08.500
It's time

03:10.030 --> 03:11.170
to take a junior

03:11.870 --> 03:13.010
and start a new chapter.

03:14.030 --> 03:16.060
Let me begin with this variable.

03:23.090 --> 03:31.140
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

03:31.140 --> 03:38.900
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

03:55.480 --> 03:57.500
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

03:57.500 --> 04:01.370
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

04:03.380 --> 04:05.490
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

04:05.490 --> 04:09.280
♪Be brave enough
to split the primal chaos wide open♪

04:46.940 --> 04:48.180
[Pull Strings]

04:48.180 --> 04:49.940
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

04:49.940 --> 04:52.820
[Episode 1]

04:54.950 --> 05:00.900
[Ascendance Sect]
♪Chaos broke; the ancient beasts fell♪

05:01.630 --> 05:07.900
[Jade Division, Ascendance Sect]
♪Millions of years flew by♪

05:08.310 --> 05:14.370
♪No immortal terrace in sight♪

05:15.070 --> 05:21.980
♪Only the songs of immortals are heard♪

05:21.980 --> 05:23.720
[Qi Yuan, Lord of Jade Division]

05:23.720 --> 05:24.490
Ling'e.

05:24.700 --> 05:25.560
[Lan Ling'e]

05:25.560 --> 05:27.980
This is the Divine Land,

05:28.070 --> 05:30.780
the finest cultivation land
in the Three Realms.

05:31.040 --> 05:32.340
Behold these immortal mountains.

05:32.480 --> 05:33.980
They're blessed with spiritual grace.

05:34.360 --> 05:36.020
Truly grand indeed.

05:38.680 --> 05:40.020
Truly grand.

05:42.310 --> 05:42.810
Ling'e.

05:47.480 --> 05:48.540
Be careful.

05:49.750 --> 05:51.410
Consider this a test.

05:51.630 --> 05:54.100
Have your senior
repair the bridge later.

05:56.560 --> 05:57.140
Ling'e.

05:57.360 --> 05:57.850
Mentor.

06:04.830 --> 06:06.020
It's all your senior's fault.

06:06.180 --> 06:09.160
[Jade Division]

06:09.160 --> 06:10.170
It has not been tended
for quite some time.

06:12.430 --> 06:13.220
Ling'e,

06:13.870 --> 06:16.250
since today, you've become my disciple.

06:16.270 --> 06:17.250
I require

06:17.270 --> 06:18.580
that you cultivate diligently.

06:18.600 --> 06:20.220
Do not slacken in the slightest.

06:20.680 --> 06:23.220
Strive to succeed at your earliest.

06:23.510 --> 06:24.290
Yes.

06:25.430 --> 06:27.370
Mentor, have you attained immortality?

06:30.720 --> 06:31.730
Soon.

06:31.830 --> 06:34.460
During my early years of cultivation,

06:34.560 --> 06:36.170
I made a slight mistake.

06:37.190 --> 06:37.980
Come with me.

06:38.510 --> 06:38.930
Okay.

06:39.060 --> 06:39.800
[Hall of United Spirits]

06:39.800 --> 06:43.660
I shall handle your initiation shortly.

06:44.000 --> 06:45.660
Although we have

06:45.680 --> 06:47.340
only three members,

06:47.600 --> 06:50.700
the formalities must still be observed.

06:53.000 --> 06:53.660
Mentor,

06:53.870 --> 06:55.340
I have often heard you mention Senior.

06:56.000 --> 06:57.460
What sort of person is he?

06:57.800 --> 07:00.580
You've been at Mistveil Division
for almost six months.

07:00.600 --> 07:03.100
What rumors have you heard about him?

07:04.240 --> 07:05.660
I have heard that...

07:05.920 --> 07:08.980
As if he does not exist
in the Ascendance Sect.

07:11.040 --> 07:12.580
Exactly.

07:13.870 --> 07:15.810
That little rascal

07:16.830 --> 07:18.610
is always so secretive.

07:19.040 --> 07:20.980
In the Primordial Wilds,
the strong are revered.

07:21.040 --> 07:23.020
Every promising disciple
rises to prominence,

07:23.040 --> 07:25.020
gaining renown, and shining brilliantly.

07:25.040 --> 07:25.810
But he...

07:26.070 --> 07:27.730
The more he cultivates,
the less notice he draws.

07:28.040 --> 07:29.490
The more he cultivates,
the less notice he draws.

07:29.510 --> 07:30.170
The more...

07:30.630 --> 07:31.140
Mentor.

07:32.310 --> 07:32.810
Mentor.

07:33.000 --> 07:33.700
Mentor, Mentor!

07:35.240 --> 07:35.660
This...

07:37.920 --> 07:38.730
Mentor.

07:39.240 --> 07:41.700
No wonder you have yet
to attain immortality.

07:44.270 --> 07:44.930
Mentor.

07:45.390 --> 07:46.100
Mentor.

07:47.750 --> 07:48.290
Mentor.

07:50.000 --> 07:51.490
I'm feeling dizzy too.

08:02.580 --> 08:05.860
[Li Changshou,
disciple of Jade Division]

08:16.240 --> 08:17.370
This place has always been

08:17.390 --> 08:19.370
home to just Mentor and me.

08:19.750 --> 08:22.290
[Good Luck, Certain Victory]
Outsiders will trigger

08:22.310 --> 08:23.580
the mechanisms I have set.

08:24.160 --> 08:25.340
Allow me to examine you first.

08:26.950 --> 08:29.050
Six senses, six worlds.
Six roots, six desires.

08:29.560 --> 08:30.050
Search.

08:42.390 --> 08:43.610
Her soul is clean.

08:43.960 --> 08:44.700
No soul possession.

08:44.720 --> 08:45.530
No inner demons.

08:45.550 --> 08:46.730
No gu planted, either.

08:57.510 --> 08:58.300
What are you doing?

09:00.630 --> 09:01.770
Where did that bell come from?

09:05.030 --> 09:06.370
It was left to me by my late mother.

09:07.240 --> 09:07.650
Your late mother?

09:11.150 --> 09:11.940
My apologies.

09:12.240 --> 09:13.700
There is one more step to complete.

09:17.600 --> 09:18.530
[Part I: Basics]
May I ask:

09:19.200 --> 09:21.220
In your genealogy of 18 generations,

09:21.240 --> 09:23.610
were there any grievously evil persons?

09:24.630 --> 09:25.580
Who are you?

09:26.630 --> 09:27.610
It seems there were none.

09:29.030 --> 09:31.220
Have you ever made statements in public

09:31.240 --> 09:33.010
disrespectful to the human race?

09:33.440 --> 09:34.220
Where is my mentor?

09:34.240 --> 09:35.770
And who is your mentor?

09:36.200 --> 09:37.060
My mentor is...

09:37.080 --> 09:37.850
Let her go!

09:38.910 --> 09:39.700
Mentor!

09:39.840 --> 09:40.420
Mentor!

09:40.440 --> 09:41.420
Release her at once!

09:41.630 --> 09:42.420
Mentor!

09:43.480 --> 09:44.250
He...

09:46.870 --> 09:49.490
Who rigs their own nest
with so many traps?

09:49.630 --> 09:50.730
Afraid of thieves, huh?

09:50.750 --> 09:52.420
You are quite something now.

09:52.480 --> 09:53.530
You have improved.

09:53.870 --> 09:55.220
You even withstood
the Softspirit Powder.

09:56.080 --> 09:57.010
You underestimate me.

09:57.030 --> 09:57.610
Let me tell you.

09:57.630 --> 09:58.700
I have consumed more knockout powder

09:58.720 --> 10:00.250
than the Great Restoration Pills
you have ever taken.

10:01.440 --> 10:02.940
Mentor, what is there to boast about?

10:03.910 --> 10:04.770
A disciple of Jade Division

10:04.790 --> 10:05.890
may be killed but not dishonored.

10:07.200 --> 10:07.980
A disciple?

10:08.030 --> 10:09.530
You failed to strive hard,

10:09.550 --> 10:11.580
so I have to take another disciple.

10:13.000 --> 10:14.100
Mentor, why are you kneeling?

10:14.120 --> 10:15.340
I did not mean to kneel.

10:15.360 --> 10:16.490
But I am too dizzy.

10:17.080 --> 10:17.850
Mentor.

10:23.000 --> 10:23.770
Senior.

10:41.480 --> 10:43.010
I have had no parents since childhood.

10:43.030 --> 10:44.130
I wandered everywhere.

10:44.150 --> 10:45.530
Half a year ago, the Mistveil Division

10:45.550 --> 10:46.770
took me in
as an outer-sect probationary disciple.

10:47.120 --> 10:48.100
They said it was probationary;

10:48.120 --> 10:49.250
in truth, it was mere menial labor.

10:49.750 --> 10:51.100
I endured all manner of humiliation.

10:51.120 --> 10:52.370
I simply could not bear it any longer,

10:52.510 --> 10:54.100
so I fled down the mountain.

10:54.960 --> 10:56.820
Fortunately, Mentor passed by.

11:04.120 --> 11:04.700
Mentor...

11:04.720 --> 11:05.220
No.

11:05.870 --> 11:06.650
Child.

11:07.320 --> 11:10.180
The Mistveil Division
has always been high-handed.

11:11.080 --> 11:13.180
She's such a fine piece of jade,

11:13.320 --> 11:15.370
and they tortured her so cruelly.

11:15.550 --> 11:17.220
Look at her.

11:17.440 --> 11:18.220
Look.

11:18.750 --> 11:19.370
Look at her.

11:19.750 --> 11:21.250
Look what they have done to her.

11:22.910 --> 11:25.060
If we don't intervene,

11:25.080 --> 11:26.100
who will?

11:30.720 --> 11:32.460
In that case,

11:36.720 --> 11:37.820
listen to this question.

11:38.120 --> 11:38.890
Question?

11:39.120 --> 11:40.220
If you're at the Ascension Stage IX,

11:40.240 --> 11:40.940
and one day, you discover

11:40.960 --> 11:42.060
a Qi refiner at the Ascension Stage VI

11:42.080 --> 11:43.300
harassing a female disciple
at the Refining Stage.

11:43.320 --> 11:44.300
What should you do?

11:44.550 --> 11:45.610
Wait, I... He...

11:45.840 --> 11:47.300
A: Go and kill him.

11:47.320 --> 11:48.650
B: Throw a magic instrument from afar.

11:48.670 --> 11:50.100
C: Pretend you saw nothing.

11:50.120 --> 11:51.010
Which do you choose?

11:51.030 --> 11:51.890
No, wait!

11:51.910 --> 11:52.890
Three... two...

11:53.240 --> 11:53.680
One.

11:53.680 --> 11:54.300
I'll go and kill him!

12:04.200 --> 12:05.060
Be off with you, then.

12:05.080 --> 12:05.490
Senior.

12:11.080 --> 12:11.610
Insolent!

12:11.630 --> 12:12.420
What are you doing?

12:12.600 --> 12:14.250
This is no place for her.

12:14.600 --> 12:15.650
What nonsense!

12:16.870 --> 12:17.650
Please, sit.

12:18.870 --> 12:19.770
At the last Sect Competition,

12:19.790 --> 12:20.940
what was
the Mistveil Division's ranking?

12:20.960 --> 12:22.250
Testing me?

12:22.270 --> 12:23.530
Among the 800 divisions,

12:23.550 --> 12:24.700
their rankings never budge.

12:24.870 --> 12:26.730
Griefbane Division, Skyrend Division,
Mistveil Division...

12:28.600 --> 12:29.850
And what of the Jade Division?

12:30.340 --> 12:33.380
[800th in the Sect Competition]

12:35.790 --> 12:37.940
As my prized disciple,

12:38.360 --> 12:40.980
you have held fast to 800th place.

12:41.000 --> 12:42.530
How dare you bring that up?

12:43.550 --> 12:44.850
[800th in the Sect Competition]
Half that shame

12:44.870 --> 12:46.730
is yours.

12:47.480 --> 12:48.730
Besides,

12:48.960 --> 12:50.060
among the 800 Lords,

12:50.150 --> 12:51.340
aren't you the only one

12:51.360 --> 12:52.730
who has yet to become immortal?

12:56.240 --> 12:56.980
Wait. After all that talk,

12:57.000 --> 12:58.730
what does this have to do with Ling'e?

12:58.750 --> 13:00.100
The gap in strength is enormous.

13:00.120 --> 13:01.940
Yet we are to tend
someone else's cold hearth?

13:02.030 --> 13:05.130
Would that not just invite trouble?

13:05.480 --> 13:06.850
Invite trouble...

13:06.870 --> 13:08.610
You are simply afraid.

13:08.670 --> 13:09.580
You never change.

13:09.600 --> 13:10.530
You change too easily.

13:10.550 --> 13:11.730
You make things up as you go.

13:11.750 --> 13:12.530
You move without a trace.

13:12.550 --> 13:13.530
Our sect is unfortunate.

13:13.550 --> 13:13.940
You are...

13:13.960 --> 13:14.130
Senior.

13:14.150 --> 13:14.650
You are...

13:14.960 --> 13:15.460
Senior.

13:18.910 --> 13:20.940
Give me one more chance.

13:20.960 --> 13:22.060
I can surely do it.

13:26.320 --> 13:27.220
Listen to the question.

13:27.520 --> 13:29.050
You: Ascension Stage IX.

13:29.070 --> 13:30.810
Male disciple: Ascension Stage VI.

13:30.870 --> 13:32.970
He's harassing a female disciple
at the Refining Stage.

13:33.110 --> 13:34.220
What do you do?

13:34.550 --> 13:35.900
B: Throw a magic instrument at him.

13:36.920 --> 13:37.740
Senior!

13:41.510 --> 13:42.330
My leg.

13:44.920 --> 13:46.180
Senior! Senior!

13:50.480 --> 13:51.300
Mentor.

13:53.270 --> 13:54.060
Well...

13:54.120 --> 13:55.700
May Senior let me in now?

13:56.440 --> 13:57.460
Not yet. Not now.

13:58.030 --> 13:59.010
Do not worry, Ling'e.

13:59.480 --> 14:00.220
Who am I?

14:00.240 --> 14:02.010
I am the Lord of Jade Division.

14:02.030 --> 14:03.220
My word is law here.

14:03.480 --> 14:05.340
If need be, I shall stand guard here.

14:05.360 --> 14:07.180
That wayward disciple
will have to agree.

14:12.550 --> 14:13.700
Thank you, Mentor.

14:14.510 --> 14:15.300
But...

14:15.670 --> 14:16.460
No need.

14:17.120 --> 14:18.300
Since Senior dislikes me here,

14:18.320 --> 14:19.820
I will not insist on staying.

14:19.960 --> 14:21.100
Mentor, please take care.

14:21.320 --> 14:21.820
I am leaving.

14:22.510 --> 14:23.060
Ling'e.

14:24.120 --> 14:24.890
Ling'e.

14:26.720 --> 14:28.850
I rule the Jade Division.

14:29.960 --> 14:30.730
You...

14:49.440 --> 14:51.370
Have you no compassion at all?

14:53.080 --> 14:54.580
When I found you back then,

14:54.720 --> 14:56.770
you were no better off than her.

14:57.030 --> 14:57.890
Yes, yes.

14:58.030 --> 14:59.490
Taking me in back then

14:59.510 --> 15:01.130
left you utterly exhausted,

15:01.150 --> 15:02.700
so you couldn't focus
on your own cultivation.

15:03.150 --> 15:04.770
Stop being sarcastic.

15:06.440 --> 15:07.850
My foundation was destroyed back then,

15:07.960 --> 15:09.300
so my progress was always slow.

15:10.510 --> 15:12.890
If not for the immortal elixirs
you refined for me,

15:13.360 --> 15:15.370
I could not even maintain
my current stage.

15:18.910 --> 15:21.250
In all the world,
useless mentors like me

15:21.270 --> 15:22.180
are few indeed.

15:22.910 --> 15:25.300
But I can't ignore children

15:25.320 --> 15:28.060
like you and Ling'e.

15:28.910 --> 15:30.010
Cultivating immortality

15:31.630 --> 15:34.250
is not merely about cultivation;

15:35.720 --> 15:37.100
it is about humanity.

15:57.120 --> 15:59.460
Isn't this Lan Ling'e?

15:59.480 --> 16:00.010
Let me go!

16:00.320 --> 16:01.130
Our outer disciple?

16:02.320 --> 16:03.580
The Mistveil Division has come for her!

16:04.270 --> 16:04.940
You will not intervene?

16:04.960 --> 16:05.890
Fine, then I will.

16:06.910 --> 16:07.340
Freeze!

16:08.670 --> 16:09.820
Release me, you insolent disciple!

16:09.840 --> 16:10.940
Patience, Mentor.

16:11.080 --> 16:12.770
Just watch me handle this.

16:14.440 --> 16:15.490
- What outer disciple?
- Let me go!

16:15.790 --> 16:17.010
She's only been here half a year,

16:17.030 --> 16:18.490
a menial servant without a mentor.

16:18.840 --> 16:20.130
How dare you

16:20.320 --> 16:21.530
crack a senior's head open?

16:22.030 --> 16:22.730
You are courting death.

16:23.150 --> 16:23.940
What is this?

16:24.720 --> 16:25.730
Trying to run?

16:26.670 --> 16:28.610
[Yuan Heng, Mistveil Division]
Thinking of Jade Division?

16:29.320 --> 16:30.850
They won't have you either.

16:31.100 --> 16:31.630
[Yuan Lang, Mistveil Division]

16:31.630 --> 16:32.220
You little

16:32.720 --> 16:33.300
piece of trash.

16:34.600 --> 16:35.370
Yuan Man.

16:35.910 --> 16:37.940
[Yuan Man, Mistveil Division]
She broke my head to save you.

16:38.120 --> 16:40.340
Why not play the hero too?

16:41.720 --> 16:42.250
I would not dare.

16:42.630 --> 16:44.420
Senior, I will go keep watch.

16:45.200 --> 16:46.460
You struck me once.

16:47.150 --> 16:48.300
I shall return tenfold.

16:48.550 --> 16:49.610
Perfectly fair, isn't it?

16:54.880 --> 16:56.900
Let me go. I must save that child.

16:56.920 --> 16:57.700
The time is not yet right.

16:57.720 --> 16:58.700
Calm down. Wait a little longer.

16:58.720 --> 16:59.700
What are you waiting for?

17:00.430 --> 17:01.490
A 98% chance.

17:01.510 --> 17:02.700
What is it now?

17:03.430 --> 17:04.250
Right now,

17:04.510 --> 17:05.410
97%, perhaps.

17:05.510 --> 17:07.380
97%? Why wait?

17:07.920 --> 17:08.930
Less than 98%

17:09.510 --> 17:11.060
means suicide.

17:17.200 --> 17:17.690
Go!

17:20.000 --> 17:20.770
What are you doing?

17:21.230 --> 17:22.610
Let go of me! Let me see!

17:27.070 --> 17:28.050
Why are you hitting me?

17:28.070 --> 17:28.850
I didn't!

17:30.590 --> 17:31.090
Who?

17:31.550 --> 17:32.250
Was it you?

17:33.400 --> 17:34.330
Was it you?

17:34.510 --> 17:34.980
Was it you?

17:35.000 --> 17:35.570
No, no.

17:38.240 --> 17:39.420
Why are you hitting me again?

17:39.590 --> 17:40.460
Why are you pushing me?

17:40.480 --> 17:41.700
Clearly, you hit me.

17:41.720 --> 17:42.460
Why are you hitting me?

17:42.550 --> 17:44.050
Why are you hitting me? Why?

17:45.240 --> 17:45.570
Stop!

17:46.070 --> 17:46.730
Stop!

17:47.830 --> 17:50.380
We're here to discipline Lan Ling'e.

17:50.400 --> 17:52.180
Why hit me?

17:52.200 --> 17:53.530
- You struck first.
- Let me go!

17:53.550 --> 17:54.530
- No, I...
- Fine.

17:56.200 --> 17:56.980
Lan Ling'e,

17:57.110 --> 17:58.380
you won't get away today.

17:58.400 --> 17:59.980
Who says so?

18:02.400 --> 18:03.180
Mentor.

18:04.510 --> 18:05.700
Easy now. Easy.

18:06.510 --> 18:07.420
Right now, you have not joined

18:08.200 --> 18:10.490
my division.

18:12.400 --> 18:14.490
I am Qi Yuan,

18:16.000 --> 18:17.770
Lord of Jade Division.

18:17.790 --> 18:20.380
Kuai Si of Mistveil Division is my peer.

18:20.400 --> 18:22.180
I entered the sect before him.

18:23.440 --> 18:24.660
So, by seniority,

18:25.200 --> 18:28.380
you should call me Uncle

18:28.640 --> 18:30.050
or Granduncle.

18:31.030 --> 18:32.250
Uncle? Please.

18:33.070 --> 18:34.290
You're just an old man
with a damaged foundation,

18:34.310 --> 18:35.810
yet to undergo the Tribulation.

18:36.960 --> 18:37.420
Isn't that so?

18:37.480 --> 18:38.090
Exactly.

18:38.550 --> 18:39.180
That's right.

18:43.680 --> 18:44.460
You guys

18:45.270 --> 18:47.810
hurt this little girl so badly.

18:49.030 --> 18:51.490
I will not stand by.

18:52.030 --> 18:53.460
Then what do you want?

18:54.480 --> 18:55.900
We're purging our division.

18:56.000 --> 18:57.620
What has it to do with you?

18:58.160 --> 18:58.980
Exactly.

19:04.070 --> 19:04.900
I have heard

19:05.070 --> 19:07.860
of your division rules.

19:07.880 --> 19:08.940
If I recall correctly,

19:09.600 --> 19:11.450
you have a curfew, right?

19:13.360 --> 19:14.460
Trying to scare me?

19:14.890 --> 19:16.140
- I am scared.
- Oh, no, Senior.

19:16.200 --> 19:17.050
We were too busy fighting

19:17.280 --> 19:18.340
and forgot to check the time.

19:18.760 --> 19:19.980
For disciples of the Mistveil Division

19:20.600 --> 19:22.020
who fail to return by sunset,

19:23.680 --> 19:24.900
how many lashes was it again?

19:27.310 --> 19:29.180
Senior, let's hurry back.

19:29.200 --> 19:30.250
Any later, and it'll be too late.

19:30.590 --> 19:31.010
Let's go, hurry!

19:31.030 --> 19:31.660
Lan Ling'e,

19:31.830 --> 19:33.770
if I don't teach you a lesson today...

19:34.680 --> 19:35.490
No, no, not again.

19:35.510 --> 19:36.420
I'm not leaving then.

19:36.440 --> 19:37.010
Wait.

19:37.640 --> 19:38.770
Didn't you hear it?

19:39.240 --> 19:40.250
Listen more carefully.

19:43.350 --> 19:45.530
The Grandlord's patrol crane.

19:49.030 --> 19:50.810
The Grandlord resides
in Griefbane Division.

19:50.830 --> 19:54.730
The patrol crane patrols 800 divisions.

19:54.750 --> 19:56.530
Today, it came here.

19:58.000 --> 19:58.900
Hurry, pay respects!

20:02.550 --> 20:03.380
What a coincidence.

20:04.920 --> 20:06.730
This patrol crane

20:07.720 --> 20:09.290
is also an old friend.

20:10.680 --> 20:11.660
It said

20:12.200 --> 20:14.660
that if you keep causing trouble,

20:16.000 --> 20:17.290
it'll peck your eyes out.

20:17.920 --> 20:18.420
Peck them out!

20:33.240 --> 20:34.220
Senior.

20:34.240 --> 20:35.380
See? You talk too much.

20:42.200 --> 20:43.010
Yuan Qing is here.

20:43.030 --> 20:43.900
Senior.

20:44.900 --> 20:48.140
[Yuan Qing, head disciple
of Mistveil Division]

20:50.750 --> 20:51.460
Yuan Qing.

20:52.200 --> 20:53.490
It's almost nightfall.

20:53.720 --> 20:55.220
Why aren't you back yet?

20:56.160 --> 20:57.010
It's all their fault.

20:57.960 --> 20:58.330
They...

21:02.880 --> 21:03.770
I understand.

21:04.510 --> 21:06.290
You had your reasons; it's forgivable.

21:06.830 --> 21:09.010
When we return,
if Mentor punishes you,

21:09.310 --> 21:10.420
I'll plead for you.

21:11.070 --> 21:12.180
Thank you, Senior.

21:19.030 --> 21:20.980
I'm Yuan Qing,
disciple of Mistveil Division.

21:21.160 --> 21:22.900
Greetings, Uncle Qi Yuan.

21:28.350 --> 21:29.490
Yuan Qing,

21:30.000 --> 21:31.290
no need for such courtesy.

21:31.350 --> 21:32.140
Uncle,

21:32.750 --> 21:34.980
Lan Ling'e is punished at our division.

21:35.110 --> 21:36.140
By the sect's laws,

21:36.160 --> 21:37.570
she may not join another division.

21:37.640 --> 21:39.180
Please return Lan Ling'e.

21:39.200 --> 21:40.140
Yuan Qing,

21:41.110 --> 21:42.900
cultivation is about humanity.

21:43.070 --> 21:44.490
We should honor affection.

21:45.070 --> 21:46.810
Lan Ling'e has no formal mentor.

21:46.830 --> 21:48.570
Why mind where she goes?

21:50.880 --> 21:51.660
Uncle.

21:52.270 --> 21:53.730
Forgive my blunt words.

21:53.750 --> 21:56.490
You mimicked
the Grandlord's patrol crane.

21:56.880 --> 21:58.460
That was overstepping.

21:59.750 --> 22:01.980
If I tell the Grandlord,

22:02.310 --> 22:03.090
I fear

22:04.310 --> 22:05.730
it may not favor you.

22:06.310 --> 22:08.660
Yuan Qing, don't use him to scare me.

22:08.920 --> 22:09.660
So what if he comes?

22:09.680 --> 22:10.810
Kuai Si is my junior.

22:11.030 --> 22:11.730
He... I...

22:11.750 --> 22:12.250
She's here.

22:19.030 --> 22:21.090
Wine is the bane of grief.

22:21.160 --> 22:23.570
The Detached Master has nine disciples.

22:23.590 --> 22:24.940
All bear the Jiu character.
[*Jiu: wine]

22:25.240 --> 22:27.980
She is young, with a high seniority.

22:28.000 --> 22:30.460
She's the last disciple
in the Griefbane Division.

22:30.590 --> 22:32.570
Good at swordsmanship, fond of wine.

22:33.000 --> 22:34.810
[Jiu Jiu, Griefbane Division]
She is Aunt Jiu Jiu.

22:35.880 --> 22:37.180
Aunt Jiu Jiu loves wine.

22:37.350 --> 22:39.570
Our Pearl Brew has a wondrous scent.

22:39.920 --> 22:40.940
She'll definitely come.

22:41.200 --> 22:41.810
Wine!

22:42.830 --> 22:43.250
Go!

22:43.640 --> 22:44.620
Target: Jade Division.

22:51.270 --> 22:53.250
Now I'm 98% sure.

22:57.160 --> 22:58.530
This is the scent.

22:59.480 --> 23:00.330
Let's talk.

23:01.310 --> 23:02.380
What's going on?

23:02.510 --> 23:03.140
Aunt.

23:03.310 --> 23:04.050
It was them.

23:04.240 --> 23:05.220
They...

23:07.480 --> 23:09.220
And they came to bully me!

23:09.350 --> 23:10.050
Aunt, I...

23:10.070 --> 23:10.700
Junior Jiu Jiu,

23:11.310 --> 23:12.180
I can bear witness.

23:18.110 --> 23:18.980
Look, look!

23:19.160 --> 23:19.980
Seeing is believing.

23:20.000 --> 23:20.490
Oh, my heavens!

23:20.510 --> 23:21.660
Look what they've done
to this poor girl.

23:22.200 --> 23:23.420
But she also struck my senior's head!

23:23.440 --> 23:24.570
The witnesses and evidence are all here.

23:24.590 --> 23:25.290
Yuan Qing,

23:26.000 --> 23:27.290
do you have anything else to say?

23:31.880 --> 23:32.660
Aunt,

23:33.590 --> 23:34.620
I have been foolish.

23:34.880 --> 23:36.180
I only listened to one side of the story

23:36.720 --> 23:37.810
and harmed Junior Ling'e.

23:39.070 --> 23:40.140
I know my mistake now.

23:40.640 --> 23:41.530
Junior Ling'e.

23:42.200 --> 23:43.420
It was all my fault before.

23:43.590 --> 23:44.660
I let you suffer unfairly.

23:45.790 --> 23:46.940
Now that the truth is clear,

23:47.510 --> 23:48.980
if you will return with me,

23:49.000 --> 23:50.770
I will clear your name with Mentor.

23:51.920 --> 23:53.180
Weren't you the ones who made me leave?

23:53.200 --> 23:54.420
So, now, I am leaving.

23:55.440 --> 23:56.770
That is what I wanted to hear.

23:56.880 --> 23:58.420
Ling'e has not bowed to a mentor.

23:58.440 --> 23:59.940
She is free to go where she wishes.

23:59.960 --> 24:00.660
Yuan Qing,

24:01.110 --> 24:01.900
what do you think?

24:02.200 --> 24:03.900
She is backing the Jade Division.

24:05.920 --> 24:06.620
Then...

24:07.160 --> 24:08.620
We shall follow your words.

24:09.400 --> 24:09.900
Yes.

24:10.790 --> 24:11.570
You...

24:12.350 --> 24:14.330
You harassed your peers, fought outside,

24:14.350 --> 24:15.460
and stayed out so late.

24:16.240 --> 24:18.570
You've brought shame to our division.

24:18.790 --> 24:20.220
All of you, go back and be punished!

24:20.680 --> 24:21.570
Yes, Senior.

24:22.350 --> 24:23.140
Stop!

24:28.510 --> 24:29.290
That's it?

24:32.310 --> 24:34.180
Anything wrong with my actions?

24:34.200 --> 24:35.380
Please enlighten me.

24:35.510 --> 24:36.900
You smashed this jar of fine wine.

24:37.720 --> 24:38.620
Aren't you going to apologize to it?

24:39.070 --> 24:39.570
This...

24:46.070 --> 24:47.660
I accept punishment willingly.

24:47.880 --> 24:48.420
Ten jars.

24:48.790 --> 24:49.730
Give me now.

24:49.960 --> 24:50.620
Ten?

24:50.830 --> 24:51.140
This...

24:53.030 --> 24:53.980
Worth the trip.

24:54.510 --> 24:55.010
Thanks.

24:55.160 --> 24:55.620
Going back.

25:01.680 --> 25:03.490
Mentor, am I really safe?

25:04.480 --> 25:05.250
Heavens.

25:05.310 --> 25:06.730
So, how did Aunt Jiu Jiu

25:06.750 --> 25:08.730
just happen to pass by

25:08.750 --> 25:10.290
and save me?

25:10.310 --> 25:11.380
Right, and that crane too.

25:11.400 --> 25:13.380
I arranged all that.

25:13.720 --> 25:15.050
Mentor, you really are...

25:15.160 --> 25:17.010
Ling'e, you're truly naive.

25:19.240 --> 25:20.460
It was him.

25:20.790 --> 25:21.420
He...

25:33.720 --> 25:35.250
Do you know what you did wrong?

25:36.350 --> 25:37.140
What?

25:37.680 --> 25:39.980
When you see a Qi refiner
at the Ascension Stage VI

25:40.000 --> 25:41.860
harassing a female disciple,

25:42.510 --> 25:43.860
you'll choose to go kill him.

25:44.030 --> 25:46.660
How can you know
he wasn't hiding his strength?

25:48.720 --> 25:50.700
That's a beast who'd commit
such a vile act.

25:51.590 --> 25:52.730
Would he be so honest?

25:55.110 --> 25:57.050
Am I wrong to hurl
a magic instrument at him?

25:57.160 --> 25:59.140
How do you know he doesn't have one?

25:59.550 --> 26:00.940
If he is a Great Immortal,

26:01.160 --> 26:02.460
with power above yours,

26:02.960 --> 26:05.140
and you anger him, how will you escape?

26:06.480 --> 26:07.250
Moreover,

26:07.440 --> 26:08.980
you are a female disciple yourself.

26:09.240 --> 26:11.250
If that brute turns and harasses you,

26:11.680 --> 26:12.860
what can you possibly do?

26:16.750 --> 26:19.420
In the Primordial World,
all is uncertain.

26:20.510 --> 26:21.980
You think you are saving someone,

26:22.000 --> 26:23.460
but you are only harming yourself.

26:23.960 --> 26:25.460
You think you are doing good,

26:25.790 --> 26:28.180
but you are courting your own ruin.

26:29.720 --> 26:30.980
Love can breed hate.

26:31.750 --> 26:32.900
Helping can be harmful too.

26:33.440 --> 26:35.900
Rash actions always lead to tragedy.

26:39.750 --> 26:41.700
Then, I was wrong.

26:43.070 --> 26:44.290
To survive,

26:44.680 --> 26:46.050
there is only one method.

26:46.830 --> 26:48.460
Stay away from all disputes and karma.

26:48.480 --> 26:49.860
Focus on protecting yourself.

26:49.960 --> 26:51.250
If everyone protects themselves

26:51.270 --> 26:52.220
and harms no one else,

26:52.240 --> 26:54.050
wouldn't the world be wonderful?

26:55.510 --> 26:56.290
So,

26:57.110 --> 26:58.140
you know the answer?

26:58.480 --> 26:59.250
I do.

27:00.030 --> 27:01.380
Tell me loudly.

27:02.030 --> 27:03.250
What should you do?

27:03.750 --> 27:04.530
I...

27:06.830 --> 27:07.810
I'll pretend I didn't see it

27:08.000 --> 27:08.860
and go find you.

27:10.790 --> 27:11.460
Junior.

27:12.550 --> 27:13.330
Please.

27:13.500 --> 27:15.980
[Steady]

27:16.720 --> 27:18.180
So much delicious food.

27:18.750 --> 27:19.530
Come.

27:20.480 --> 27:21.250
Mentor.

27:22.110 --> 27:23.660
Shouldn't you have tea first?

27:26.790 --> 27:29.220
To the old tree sprouting anew

27:29.750 --> 27:30.980
and new additions to the family.

27:31.000 --> 27:32.420
You never have a kind word.

27:36.640 --> 27:37.180
Good.

27:44.480 --> 27:45.250
Senior,

27:45.640 --> 27:46.700
please have some tea.

28:11.310 --> 28:13.050
Did you know that the Mistveil Division

28:13.070 --> 28:14.620
would come for her?

28:16.350 --> 28:18.250
To have Ling'e stay here,

28:18.400 --> 28:19.700
we had to face this sooner or later.

28:21.350 --> 28:23.810
Senior, you wanted me to stay?

28:23.880 --> 28:25.570
Then why set up all those plans?

28:25.590 --> 28:26.570
Your senior here

28:26.590 --> 28:27.700
learns nothing else,

28:27.880 --> 28:29.860
but when it comes to sly schemes,

28:29.880 --> 28:31.570
if he ranks second
in the Ascendance Sect,

28:31.590 --> 28:32.860
no one dares rank first.

28:33.070 --> 28:34.220
I'm telling you.

28:34.680 --> 28:35.810
Remember one word:

28:36.480 --> 28:37.250
Steady.

28:38.480 --> 28:39.250
[Steady]
Senior,

28:40.070 --> 28:41.980
you are truly far too steady.

28:44.000 --> 28:44.770
Senior.

28:46.070 --> 28:47.770
Open that lid.

28:47.880 --> 28:50.090
I made it just for you.

28:51.750 --> 28:53.290
You're not teasing me, are you?

28:58.550 --> 28:59.770
You forgot it yourself, didn't you?

29:00.590 --> 29:03.570
Today is the seventh day
of the third month.

29:04.350 --> 29:05.420
Your birthday.

29:05.830 --> 29:07.220
The day I found you.

29:12.400 --> 29:13.180
Senior.

29:14.240 --> 29:15.250
Happy birthday.

29:21.160 --> 29:23.250
Ages pass in a finger snap.

29:23.720 --> 29:25.330
Why struggle over it?

29:26.240 --> 29:27.700
[33 years ago]
The world is vast.

29:28.400 --> 29:29.380
Let's seek peace.

29:29.400 --> 29:30.570
Come back with me.

29:30.590 --> 29:32.250
You'll eat your fill every day.

29:33.350 --> 29:34.490
Why won't you heed my words?

29:42.720 --> 29:43.810
Those who cultivate the Way

29:44.830 --> 29:46.380
should keep kindness in their hearts.

29:47.400 --> 29:48.770
We cannot leave the dying unaided.

29:51.400 --> 29:53.460
This little rascal is heavy.

29:53.830 --> 29:54.620
Why should I save him?

29:55.110 --> 29:56.860
He seems stronger than I am.

29:57.440 --> 29:58.860
Sheep, follow me.

30:08.750 --> 30:09.530
Mentor.

30:10.880 --> 30:12.330
These thirty long years,

30:13.640 --> 30:14.700
you have toiled hard.

30:17.270 --> 30:18.460
You are truly disgusting.

30:18.790 --> 30:19.620
Heavens above.

30:19.720 --> 30:21.290
Take this wayward disciple.

30:22.640 --> 30:23.250
You've got a new disciple.

30:24.640 --> 30:25.380
True.

30:26.480 --> 30:27.900
Ling'e has stayed.

30:28.110 --> 30:30.490
And today is Changshou's birthday.

30:31.720 --> 30:32.530
Let us have some wine.

30:35.070 --> 30:36.010
Oh, it's this way.

30:36.550 --> 30:38.570
Century-old Pearl...

30:39.000 --> 30:39.620
Brew.

30:42.830 --> 30:43.380
Stop right there.

30:44.110 --> 30:46.730
This is my century-old Pearl Brew.

30:46.920 --> 30:48.050
Did you give it to Jiu Jiu?

30:48.270 --> 30:48.730
Mentor.

30:48.750 --> 30:50.490
Do you know how long I saved it?

30:50.510 --> 30:51.050
Mentor.

30:51.070 --> 30:52.700
- It's fine liquor, but don't drink it.
- Out!

30:52.790 --> 30:54.980
You never give me any peace.

30:55.550 --> 30:56.770
I swear...

30:59.510 --> 31:01.220
Mother. Brother.

31:02.200 --> 31:03.420
I've reached my new home.

31:05.780 --> 31:09.340
[Mistveil Division]

31:10.780 --> 31:13.540
[Hall of Virtue]

31:14.680 --> 31:16.140
Will Yuan Qing survive this?

31:18.880 --> 31:19.380
Senior.

31:20.350 --> 31:20.940
How is it?

31:21.270 --> 31:22.900
Mentor is raging inside.

31:22.920 --> 31:23.810
How long has it been?

31:28.510 --> 31:29.330
Yuan Qing,

31:30.750 --> 31:32.700
these eighty lashes of the Golden Whip

31:33.310 --> 31:35.220
are for acting on your own

31:35.960 --> 31:38.140
and disgracing our division.

31:38.550 --> 31:40.180
You're their senior.

31:40.920 --> 31:43.700
You must set an example.

31:45.200 --> 31:46.330
I know my mistake.

31:48.140 --> 31:49.790
[Kuai Si, Sect Elder,
Lord of Mistveil Division]

31:49.790 --> 31:51.660
Though I am still

31:52.350 --> 31:53.660
one step from the Aureate Stage,

31:54.960 --> 31:57.220
who is Qi Yuan to challenge me?

31:57.790 --> 31:59.530
Once I have the chance,

31:59.750 --> 32:01.810
I can reduce him to dust.

32:02.070 --> 32:02.860
Mentor.

32:04.880 --> 32:06.220
Yet after this disturbance,

32:06.830 --> 32:08.460
we did gain something.

32:17.440 --> 32:19.900
Go on. Tell me.

32:26.310 --> 32:27.250
From start to finish,

32:27.920 --> 32:29.490
the Grandlord never appeared.

32:29.790 --> 32:32.010
Aunt Jiu Jiu spoke for him.

32:33.110 --> 32:34.140
From this, we can infer

32:34.880 --> 32:36.250
that the Grandlord

32:36.960 --> 32:37.980
is still in secluded cultivation.

32:40.680 --> 32:42.330
The Detached Master is always punctual.

32:42.350 --> 32:43.980
He never delays emerging from seclusion.

32:45.750 --> 32:46.530
Could it be

32:47.510 --> 32:49.660
that he ran into some trouble?

32:50.480 --> 32:51.530
I believe

32:51.680 --> 32:54.770
extraordinary times bring
unique chances.

33:00.070 --> 33:01.700
In our division,

33:02.030 --> 33:03.810
I trust

33:05.270 --> 33:06.460
you alone.

33:06.920 --> 33:08.570
Three years later, the Training Assembly

33:08.590 --> 33:12.140
is when you'll shine for our division.

33:12.310 --> 33:13.490
Those who are worthy

33:13.880 --> 33:16.940
may stay here.

33:18.640 --> 33:21.700
Useless disciples are nothing

33:22.270 --> 33:24.330
but walking corpses.

33:26.790 --> 33:28.220
You are their senior.

33:28.790 --> 33:30.530
Handle it as you see fit.

33:34.480 --> 33:35.330
Yuan Man is the chief culprit.

33:35.350 --> 33:36.810
Yuan Qing must be making an example.

33:38.480 --> 33:39.180
He is ruined.

33:39.880 --> 33:40.810
Carry him down the mountain.

33:42.110 --> 33:43.010
Hurry, carry him away.

33:54.020 --> 33:58.860
[Steady]

34:03.750 --> 34:04.860
Tian.

34:05.160 --> 34:05.940
At your service.

34:06.830 --> 34:07.700
Open the interface.

34:14.140 --> 34:15.340
[Previous life]

34:15.380 --> 34:16.260
[Into the Ascendance Sect]

34:16.260 --> 34:17.220
[Into the Primordial World]

34:17.300 --> 34:17.780
[Reincarnation ferry]

34:31.300 --> 34:32.220
[Li Changshou's past
and present lives.mov]

34:36.740 --> 34:40.780
[33 years ago]

34:40.920 --> 34:44.010
I have one final warning.

34:44.230 --> 34:45.130
A warning?

34:45.150 --> 34:47.460
You'll go to the Great Tribulation's eve

34:48.070 --> 34:50.780
as Li Changshou, an immortal cultivator,

34:51.840 --> 34:54.650
and face countless threads of karma.

34:55.510 --> 34:56.210
Great tribulation?

34:56.400 --> 34:57.690
The comic never got this far.

34:57.710 --> 35:01.780
The Primordial World will suffer
the Great Tribulation.

35:02.190 --> 35:05.740
The world will be ruined,
full of corpses.

35:06.670 --> 35:07.860
The mortal realm

35:08.480 --> 35:09.900
will be turned

35:10.590 --> 35:11.740
into a purgatory.

35:13.670 --> 35:15.210
Li Changshou,

35:15.880 --> 35:17.010
do you like

35:17.630 --> 35:19.090
the Great Tribulation?

35:30.150 --> 35:32.530
When this sundial completes a turn,

35:33.070 --> 35:35.690
the Great Tribulation opens.

35:36.670 --> 35:38.860
All karma in this world

35:39.230 --> 35:42.740
will lead there in the end.

35:43.280 --> 35:46.010
Keep that in mind.

35:47.000 --> 35:48.690
What if this thing breaks?

35:51.440 --> 35:52.780
I jest.

35:53.960 --> 35:55.130
The time has come.

35:55.670 --> 35:58.340
You will soon be Li Changshou.

35:58.400 --> 35:59.130
Yes. Yes.

35:59.550 --> 36:00.050
Yes.

36:00.320 --> 36:00.860
Then...

36:01.510 --> 36:03.570
How am I to survive?

36:04.440 --> 36:06.210
Once you make a choice,

36:06.320 --> 36:08.570
karma is born,

36:09.840 --> 36:11.380
and every karma

36:11.670 --> 36:13.570
leads you

36:13.880 --> 36:16.130
toward an end that concerns a life.

36:16.550 --> 36:18.010
Sorry, let me interrupt.

36:19.110 --> 36:21.460
In my past life, I was gravely ill.

36:21.840 --> 36:22.940
In this life,

36:23.110 --> 36:26.340
how can I live safe and sound

36:26.630 --> 36:27.460
and stay alive?

36:28.110 --> 36:31.610
Fate only yields forty-nine;
only one can escape fate.

36:32.190 --> 36:35.130
Find the realm ruling all living beings.

36:35.150 --> 36:36.460
What is that?

36:37.400 --> 36:38.690
The Celestial Court.

36:41.760 --> 36:42.980
The Celestial Court?

36:53.670 --> 36:55.010
For these 33 years,

36:55.630 --> 36:58.090
I never slackened in my training,

36:58.480 --> 36:59.210
alchemy,

36:59.710 --> 37:00.460
and artifact refinement,

37:01.480 --> 37:03.130
and with modern knowledge,

37:03.360 --> 37:04.460
I created many artifacts

37:04.480 --> 37:06.900
beyond this age's imagining.

37:07.440 --> 37:09.860
That gave me some confidence to cope.

37:11.670 --> 37:13.130
Oh, Fate.

37:15.630 --> 37:16.740
Since then,

37:17.800 --> 37:20.490
I have been Li Changshou for 33 years.

37:20.490 --> 37:21.360
[Fate]

37:21.360 --> 37:22.300
All these years,

37:22.590 --> 37:24.460
[Don't touch karma]
I avoid all karma,

37:24.630 --> 37:25.820
lie low and take no risks,

37:26.440 --> 37:27.740
and quietly build myself up

37:27.920 --> 37:29.690
to gather enough trump cards

37:30.190 --> 37:33.340
to reach the Celestial Court
before the tribulation.

37:33.340 --> 37:34.070
[Fate, Lie low and take no risks,
Don't touch karma]

37:34.070 --> 37:36.860
[Fate, A woman, Connection]
Karma leads to the Great Tribulation.

37:37.590 --> 37:38.650
After the Great Tribulation,

37:38.650 --> 37:39.400
[Full of corpses]

37:39.400 --> 37:41.260
[Primordial World]
the Celestial Court will rule all.

37:43.760 --> 37:44.650
Tian.

37:44.880 --> 37:45.490
At your service.

37:45.630 --> 37:46.650
Open the plan schedule.

37:48.660 --> 37:52.020
[Plan Schedule, 1, Take in a junior
to open a new chapter]

37:52.400 --> 37:53.420
Junior Ling'e,

37:54.320 --> 37:56.610
I hope you won't waste my brain cells.

38:00.660 --> 38:02.580
[1. Lan Ling'e joins the sect]

38:07.420 --> 38:09.740
[2. Find the Skyscraping Vine
to reach the Celestial Court]

38:16.150 --> 38:17.300
The opportunity

38:17.630 --> 38:19.300
lies at the Training Assembly

38:19.960 --> 38:21.610
three years from now.

38:53.950 --> 38:59.730
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

39:00.400 --> 39:07.100
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

39:08.630 --> 39:14.680
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

39:15.310 --> 39:21.760
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

39:22.500 --> 39:29.620
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

39:30.000 --> 39:36.900
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

39:37.280 --> 39:44.630
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

39:44.630 --> 39:51.800
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

40:07.940 --> 40:13.110
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

40:14.200 --> 40:21.220
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

40:22.410 --> 40:28.350
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

40:29.050 --> 40:36.130
♪Alas, our story is short♪

40:36.470 --> 40:43.580
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

40:43.900 --> 40:50.380
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

40:51.160 --> 40:58.370
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

40:58.760 --> 41:06.580
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
